# Day 21 — SPEED TYPING (LEVEL 2)

You must rewrite all FOUR from scratch:

1. Ansible:
   - Install nginx
   - Start + enable service

- name: Install and start nginx
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: install nginx
      yum:
        name: nginx
        state: present
    - name: Start and enable nginx
      service:
        name: nginx
        state: started
        enabled: yes     

